  "solution": "Áp dụng công thức nhị thức Newton, ta có:\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTheo giả thiết, ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\